  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Sometimes, when uploading a Quest version of an avatar using Unity 2022, the Quest version does not appear. \n\nThis happens even though the SDK says \"Upload succeeded !\".\n\nIt's difficult to replicate since it does not happen every time. It happened to me once and it also happened to someone I know.\n\nThe only fix seems to be reverting to 2019. It fixed the issue for me.",
